"Use :ref:`machine.Pin <machine.Pin>` to read or drive any of the "
"silkscreened pins. Outputs are 3.3 V CMOS (default ``VDDIO_EXT``) and the "
"level shifters limit the per‑pin drive strength to a few milliamps — they "
